 "remarks": "A fully renovated 1,404 square foot two bedroom, two and a half bath residence in a doorman high rise, updated top to bottom in 2025 and 2026 and ready for immediate occupancy. Single level living on the scale of a house, with no stairs anywhere in the floor plan.  The all new kitchen has every appliance replaced and opens to living and dining space anchored by a custom built-in with electric fireplace and mounted frame television, both included in the sale. New flooring runs throughout, including the closets, and every room has been freshly painted.  A true split plan places two primary suites at opposite ends of the residence, each with its own gut renovated full bath taken down to the plumbing valves, plus a separate powder room. Four new air conditioning units serve the residence, and outlets and switches have been replaced throughout.  Common charges include heat, hot water and cooking gas, a dedicated garage parking space, basement storage and the fitness center, with a gym renovation funded in the 2026 budget. Both elevators are new as of 2026.  A short walk to the train station, a bus stop directly in front of the building, and minutes from I-95 and downtown Stamford restaurants and shopping.  View 3D Matterport Here: https://my.matterport.com/show/?m=mzcqKLZL5fx&mls=1",
